---
import { page, asset } from '../utils/paths';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Banner Stands" active="banner-stands">
 <section class="page-hero">
  <div class="hero-grid">

    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="hero-eyebrow">Banner Stands</span>

      <h1>Make your <span>brand</span> stand out</h1>

      <p>
        Versatile banner stands for exhibitions, events and promotional spaces.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href={page('contact/')} class="hero-btn">
          Get a Quote
          <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual">
      <img
        src={asset('assets/images/3.banner-stands/hero.png')}
        alt="Professional promotional banner stands"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

  <div class="page-content">
   <section>
     <h2>Banner Stands</h2>
   
     <p>
       Banner stands are a versatile and cost-effective way to
       promote your business, products, or services. Whether
       you're attending an exhibition, hosting a promotional
       event, or creating an eye-catching retail display,
       our banner stand solutions offer a professional and
       effective way to communicate your message.
     </p>
   
     <p>
       Designed with flexibility in mind, banner stands provide
       <strong>a practical and adaptable display solution</strong>
       that allows you to update your graphics and promotional
       messages whenever required. This makes them particularly
       suitable for businesses that regularly attend events
       or run changing marketing campaigns.
     </p>
   
     <p>
       Available in a variety of styles, heights, and widths,
       our banner stands can accommodate different display
       requirements and environments. Options include
       single-sided and double-sided displays, while selected
       systems can be joined together to create larger,
       continuous graphic walls for greater visual impact.
     </p>
   
     <p>
       Combining lightweight construction with durability,
       our banner stands are designed for convenient
       transportation, straightforward assembly, and compact
       storage. From individual promotional displays to
       larger exhibition arrangements, they offer a flexible
       solution that can adapt to your changing needs.
     </p>
   
     <h3>Key Features &amp; Benefits</h3>
   
     <ul class="check-list">
       <li>Quick and straightforward assembly and dismantling</li>
       <li>Interchangeable graphics for changing promotional messages</li>
       <li>Single-sided and double-sided display options</li>
       <li>Strong, lightweight, and durable construction</li>
       <li>Various heights, widths, and display configurations</li>
       <li>Selected systems can connect to form larger graphic walls</li>
       <li>Expandable configurations with compatible add-on frames</li>
       <li>Compact storage and convenient transportation</li>
       <li>Suitable for exhibitions, conferences, and promotional events</li>
       <li>Indoor and outdoor banner options available</li>
     </ul>
   </section>


    <section class="row image-content">
      <div class="col-sm-6">
        <img src={asset('assets/images/3.banner-stands/image1.jpg')} alt="Portable modular exhibition stand setup at a conference" />
      </div>
      <div class="col-sm-6">
        <img src={asset('assets/images/3.banner-stands/image2.jpg')} alt="Brand event display stand with promotional materials" />
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
